<title>UK: HORSE RACING-SLEEPYTIME WINS 1,000 GUINEAS.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-SLEEPYTIME WINS 1,000 GUINEAS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWMARKET 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sleepytime, ridden by Kieren Fallon, won the English 1,000 Guineas horse racing classic on Sunday.</p>
